OL,3,ATrump wants to be friends with Kim -
OL,4,Abut South Korea could pay the price
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korea's annual military exercises
OL,7,Fwith the US come to an abrupt end on
OL,8,FFriday.
OL,10,FUlchi Freedom Shield, which involves
OL,11,F18,000 South Korean troops and 11 other
OL,12,FAmerican ally nations, is being halted
OL,13,Fwith only half of the scheduled
OL,14,Fprogramme complete - days after US
OL,15,FPresident Donald Trump announced he had
OL,16,Fordered the Pentagon to "substantially
OL,17,Freduce" the drill.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
