OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump wants to be friends with Kim -
OL,4,Abut South Korea could pay the price
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis revelation by Trump, who called
OL,7,Fthe exercise "inappropriate and
OL,8,Fhostile" towards North Korea and costly
OL,9,Fto the US, caught his allies by
OL,10,Fsurprise.
OL,12,FSeoul's Foreign Minister Cho Hyun tried
OL,13,Fto paint the decision as one of mutual
OL,14,Fagreement, but admitted officials did
OL,15,Fnot know of Trump's intent to scale
OL,16,Fdown the exercise in advance.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
