OL,3,ABali jails Swiss tourist for insulting
OL,4,Asacred Day of Silence
OL,5,
OL,6,FNyepi, also known as the Day of
OL,7,FSilence, is an annual holiday during
OL,8,Fwhich the usually bustling tourist
OL,9,Fisland goes quiet, as people stay home
OL,10,Fand refrain from making loud noises.
OL,11,FThe restrictions apply to everyone on
OL,12,Fthe island regardless of religion,
OL,13,Fincluding tourists.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
